# Commit messages

Use short, single-line commit messages. Match the repo's existing style.

## Format

- One subject line only — no body paragraph
- Imperative mood, lowercase or sentence case (e.g. `update agentic workflows post date`)
- Aim for ~72 characters or less
- Append the Cursor co-author trailer on its own line:

```
Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
```

## Examples

```
update agentic workflows post date

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
```

```
add google analytics to homepage

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
```

## Avoid

```
Add Google Analytics to the homepage.

Track homepage visits with GA4 so site engagement can be measured.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
```

Do not add a second paragraph explaining the "why" unless the user explicitly asks for a longer message.
